Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:19:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle an AudioParaManger stub for the video recorder

The video modes construct android.media.AudioParaManger and implement
its listener interfaces. Stock gets the class from MIUI's
miui-framework.jar on the boot classpath, which is absent here, so the
recorder hits NoClassDefFoundError. Ship the class inside the APK, next
to the android.media.MediaCinematic it already carries. init() fails as
it does on stock hardware without the audio zoom effect, and recording
falls back to plain audio.

It goes in classes5, the dex with the most room under the 64K limit.
