 .../media/AudioParaManger$EventListener.smali |  25 ++
 .../media/AudioParaManger$TuneListener.smali  |  22 ++
 .../android/media/AudioParaManger.smali       | 276 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 323 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 smali_classes5/android/media/AudioParaManger$EventListener.smali
 create mode 100644 smali_classes5/android/media/AudioParaManger$TuneListener.smali
 create mode 100644 smali_classes5/android/media/AudioParaManger.smali

